Wed Sep 16 20:24:01 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.6.3:
  * Hardcode Mode_switch as Mod5 so bindings work with
    xkeyboard-config >= 2.37
  * Enable XKB detectable auto-repeat (ignore extra KeyRelease)
  * Export SXHKD_PID; SIGALRM aborts the current chord chain
  * Close the command log fd before exec
  * Add XF86Keyboard/WWAN/RFKill/AudioPreset/RotationLockToggle/
    FullScreen keysyms
  * Warn on interfering hotkeys; document brace escaping
- Add pkgconfig(xcb-xkb) BuildRequires (now linked)
- Spec cleanup: drop Group, add gcc/make

